# The free demo's configuration: who ships it, and where they live.
#
# There is almost nothing here, honestly so: every page renders from fixtures in its own file, so there
# is no API to point at, no database, no auth and nothing secret.
#
# The footer is the exception. A buyer shipping this template is not Viliha, and saying so should be
# two keys rather than a component edit, which is the difference between a template and a fork. The
# name is rendered verbatim: casing is part of how a company writes its own name.
#
# `NEXT_PUBLIC_` is the prefix Next inlines into the browser bundle, and only that prefix. Both are
# read at build time, so a change needs a rebuild rather than a restart.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
